          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While one or more other friendly Grey Knights infantry units are within 6" of this unit and this unit is closer or the same distance to an active enemy unit visible to this unit, this unit and those friendly infantry units gain the following ability:</characteristic>
